  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: AfterStreet3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - "I just knew you were eavesdropping again. Didn\u2019t last time teach you anything?
    Though honestly, right now you look more sad than furious. "
  - "I had to wait for the right moment to apologize. You know\u2026 so it wouldn\u2019t
    be out of nowhere."
  - "Wait, wait. No way. APOLOGIZE? Did I hear that correctly? You? That\u2019s funny."
  - "You focus too much on details. Besides, I hate that word. Makes it sound like
    I\u2019m guilty of something. Maybe just a little. "
  - A little? You and Beast got arrested because YOU got caught.
  - 'You and Cyber did too. Because of you. '
  - "Actually Cyber was inattentive and missed the signs that\u2014"
  - 'You still dragged him into crime. '
  - How do you even know that?
  - 'Cyber complained about you again. Like always. '
  - "He tells even YOU things?! Fine, whatever. But just so you know \u2014 you hate
    the word \u201Capology,\u201D meanwhile Beast keeps inventing new ways to make
    you happy."
  - Or do you think he spends money from his own debt budget on food just to feed
    all of us for fun? Do you know how much real tomatoes cost now?
  - "He was trying to do something nice for you, but still bought food for everyone
    \u2014 even Cyber \u2014 so nobody would feel left out. My father only paid for
    operating rooms so he could ruin my body with more implants."
  - 'And Cyber barely even talks to me. Meanwhile you still manage to push Beast
    into screaming arguments every other day. '
  - Ehh...Every new story somehow makes me feel even more sorry for you. No offense.
    But have you noticed that YOU provoke people too? Literally everyone, actually.
  - "And with a personalized approach too\u2026 hahaha. You openly insult Asahi,
    push his buttons with sarcasm, explode first and then ignore him."
  - With Cyber you use passive aggression and manipulate him in smarter ways than
    the way you bully Asahi. With Beast you pressure him with that stone-cold expression,
    then suddenly act sweet while somehow slipping insults and criticism into every
    sentence.
  - And every time you see me, you instantly criticize either my uselessness or my
    personality. You always know exactly where to hit. Definitely on purpose.
  - "Yes. On purpose. That\u2019s the difference. You do it unconsciously. I actually
    try. People should understand the value of their mistakes."
  - "And if nobody reminds them\u2026 they\u2019ll relax. Besides, watching people
    react to their own flaws? It\u2019s basically entertainment. "
  - "See? You\u2019re doing it again right now. Trying to provoke me. I noticed that
    you and your brother are actually very alike in many ways. Both sarcastic, both
    defensive, both easily irritated, both stubborn about your values."
  - "The difference is that he\u2019s genuinely mean\u2026 while you sometimes start
    rambling instead. Most obvious when you get embarrassed. Still\u2026 you should
    forgive me for the Cyber thing."
  - " I really was acting childish. You two are only twenty, and I\u2019m already
    in my thirties\u2026 you know I was just trying to get Beast\u2019s attention.
    I\u2019ll apologize to him too."
  - "Hm\u2026 fine. I forgive you. You know\u2026 I think if I\u2019m similar to
    my brother\u2026 maybe I\u2019m a little similar to you too? You\u2019re less
    annoying than he is. And so am I. Probably."
